    "The project licence is copied unchanged from LICENSE; no new project licence is selected.",
    "The pinned Transformers.js 2.17.2 package lists /LICENSE but no separate transformers.min.js.LICENSE.txt; its shipped browser bundle has no external licence-file reference.",
