    "The ONNX Runtime Web 1.14.0 bundle inside transformers.min.js contains long, guid-typescript, flatbuffers and onnx-proto with the protobufjs runtime (found by searching the bundle for each library's code, for example Long.fromBits, isGuid, flatbuffers and onnx.ModelProto). Their versions come from ONNX Runtime 1.14.0's js/web/package-lock.json and their licences are included."
